  "original_verification_summaries": {
    "torchcodec": "Fixed 0.10 tag contains Resize/CenterCrop/RandomCrop decoder transforms. Release describes CUDA-frame encoding through VideoEncoder; performance tips discuss decode/device choices. No robotics training benchmark was performed.",
    "lerobot": "Read fixed merge video_utils.py and test_streaming_video_encoder.py. Queue insertion waits up to its timeout then counts/reports dropped frames; per-camera threads avoid the PNG write/read round trip. Tests cover multicamera, sequential/cancelled episodes. Presence of tests is not proof of a local run.",
    "isaaclab": "Fixed beta migration docs and articulation interface establish wp.array return types and WXYZ-to-XYZW conversion. Release declares backend-specific features and beta caveats. This is not the October final release or its ProxyArray interface."
  }
